{"_v":1,"id":"bronx-bombers-2014","cs":52,"rc":16,"bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":5,"negative":10},"rv":[{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The New York Times","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.nytimes.com/2014/02/07/theater/bronx-bombers-at-circle-in-the-square.html?_r=0","d":"2014-02-06","q":"The drama inherent in clashing egos gives 'Bronx Bombers' some natural juice in the early innings, but the suspense more or less gets benched in the play's second act."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/bronx-bombers","d":"2014-02-06","q":"This fan letter to the Yankees is no home run."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/bronx-bombers-theater-review-677901","d":"2014-02-06","q":"But Bronx Bombers is ultimately too lightweight to score a theatrical home run."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":47,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2014/02/theater-review-bronx-bombers.html","d":"2014-02-06","q":"Simonson’s stabs at spiritual significance sink Bronx Bombers just as they did his previous outings."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/review-bronx-bombers-adoringly-looks-at-yanks/2014/02/06/9ce790de-8f9c-11e3-878e-d76656564a01_story.html","d":"2014-02-06","q":"The play has been tweaked since then, but not enough to make it more than Yankee advertising."},{"cn":"Linda Winder","o":"Newsday","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.newsday.com/news/new-york/theater-review-bronx-bombers-2-stars-c17067","d":"2014-02-06","q":"Scolari plays Yogi with obvious affection for a legend bent with age but unbowed in team loyalty."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/entertainment/music-arts/bronx-bombers-broadway-review-article-1.1603342","q":"When all is said and done, \"Bronx Bombers\" is too feel-good and fawning for its own good."},{"cn":"Robert Kahn","o":"NBC New York","s":61,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.nbcnewyork.com/entertainment/the-scene/bronx-bombbers-bway-review-243714131.html","d":"2014-02-06","q":"Sharpened, but still dubiously crafted, “Bronx Bombers” is a jock drama that will appeal to any Yankees fanatic, but leave others restless in the bleachers."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":50,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/theater/2014/02/06/broadway-review-bronx-bombers/5202177/","d":"2014-02-06","q":"Changing times are noted with predictable obviousness and heavy-handedness."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/theater-review-bronx-bombers-2-stars-1.6971047","d":"2014-02-06","q":"They deserve something better than this unchallenging and uninteresting history pageant."},{"cn":"Roma Torre","o":"NY1","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.ny1.com/content/lifestyles/theater_reviews/203218/ny1-theater-review---bronx-bombers-","d":"2014-02-07","q":"But theatrically speaking, it strikes out."},{"cn":"Robert Hofler","o":"TheWrap","s":41,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.thewrap.com/bronx-bombers-theater-review-yogi-berra-reggie-jackson-broadway","q":"Playwrights who direct their own plays don’t have that buffer, and this production of “Bronx Bombers” is a textbook example of why they should stick to writing."},{"cn":"Melissa Rose Bernardo","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":35,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20784296,00.html","d":"2014-02-06","q":"It’s just a bomb and not the kind that made Babe Ruth famous."},{"cn":"Robert Feldberg","o":"NorthJersey.com","s":24,"b":"Pan","t":2,"u":"https://www.northjersey.com/arts_entertainment/theater/244168841_Theater_review___Bronx_Bombers_.html?page=all","q":"Wake me when they get to horseshoes."},{"cn":"Tulis McCall","o":"Front Row Center","s":43,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://thefrontrowcenter.com/2014/02/bronx-bombers/","d":"2014-02-07","q":"But no amount of their fancy footwork can load the bases or bring home the runs."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/bronx-bombers/","d":"2014-02-11","q":"It’s an unsatisfying ending to a loose love letter to a New York institution."}],"au":{"score":38,"designation":"Loathing","sources":{"mz":{"s":38,"c":5,"sr":1.9},"rd":{"s":48,"c":646,"tp":235,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.04,"positive":0.3,"mixed":0.11,"negative":0.41,"neutral":0.14}}}},"ta":"235 W 50th St, New York, NY 10019","pd":"2014-01-10","ca":[{"n":"Peter Scolari","r":"Yogi Berra"},{"n":"Francois Battiste","r":"Reggie Jackson"},{"n":"Chris Henry Coffey","r":"Joe DiMaggio"},{"n":"Bill Dawes","r":"Mickey Mantle"},{"n":"Christopher Jackson","r":"Derek Jeter"},{"n":"Keith Nobbs","r":"Billy Martin"},{"n":"Tracy Shayne","r":"Carmen Berra"},{"n":"John Wernke","r":"Lou Gehrig"},{"n":"C. J. Wilson","r":"Babe Ruth"}]}